# Markdown as a class, not just README.md. deploy.yml skips a build for commits
# confined to '**.md', and that skip is only sound while no markdown reaches the
# image — AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md did, via `COPY . .`. Enforced by
# tests/test_deploy_workflow_filter.py.
**/*.md
